{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04759","headline":"扈从南出雀鼠谷 · 张说","name":"扈从南出雀鼠谷","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"豫动三灵赞，时巡四海威。\n陕关凌曙出，平路半春归。\n霍镇迎云罕，汾河送羽旗。\n山南柳半密，谷北草全稀。\n迟日宜华盖，和风入袷衣。\n上林千里近，应见百花飞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04759.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04759","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}